    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-289\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-289\">How we <span class=\"accent\">make and test ads</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">A monthly creative rhythm.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmsteps\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmstep cmstep--1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__when\">Week 1</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__n\">1</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Learn</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>What’s working now, and why.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmstep cmstep--2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__when\">Week 1</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__n\">2</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Concepts</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Hooks, angles and offers to test.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmstep cmstep--3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__when\">Week 2</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__n\">3</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Make</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Designs, videos and UGC.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmstep cmstep--4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__when\">Weeks 3–4</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__n\">4</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Test</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>One change at a time.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li><li class=\"cmstep cmstep--5\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__when\">Month end</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmstep__n\">5</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Learn</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Winners scaled, learnings shared.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li></ol>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
